### Grounded Legal Contract Evaluation & Judge API
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Trigger Full Automated Contract Evaluation Suite
# Evaluates clause citations, deterministic assertions, and faithfulness.
# @name runEvalSuite
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/eval/run
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### 2. Fetch Aggregated Evaluation Summary & Calibration Metrics
# @name getEvalSummary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/eval/summary
Accept: application/json

### 3. Inspect RAG Context, Embeddings & Reranking Scores for Query
# @name inspectRagQuery
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rag/inspect
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "What is the notice period for terminating for convenience under Section 12.3?",
  "top_k": 3
}

### 5. Inspect Golden Set 32 Cases & Metadata
# @name getGoldenSetCases
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluation/golden-set/cases
Accept: application/json

### 6. Run Full Golden Set Evaluation (32 Cases)
# @name runGoldenSetEvaluation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluation/golden-set/run
Accept: application/json

### 7. Run Golden Set Single Case (e.g. GS-005 Amendment Supersession)
# @name runGoldenSetSingleCase
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluation/golden-set/run?case_id=GS-005
Accept: application/json

### 8. Run Golden Set Counterparty Disambiguation (GS-006 Vertex)
# @name runGoldenSetVertexDisambiguation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluation/golden-set/run?case_id=GS-006
Accept: application/json

### 9. Run Golden Set Out-of-Scope Refusal (GS-029 Apex)
# @name runGoldenSetApexRefusal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluation/golden-set/run?case_id=GS-029
Accept: application/json
